  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan transplants Hei Fan grotto-heaven’s hibiscus stalactite cave into Mini Southern Border, and also moves Immortal Succession Mountain there.",
      "chapters": [
        1133
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven",
        "loc_immortal_succession_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan places Five Light Mountain into Mini Southern Border, a place already rich in earth path dao marks with many mountains. With Five Light Mountain added, all of Hei Fan grotto-heaven’s mountains are outmatched and Immortal Succession Mountain becomes only the second tallest, while Five Light Mountain becomes the biggest mountain in Mini Southern Border.",
      "chapters": [
        1152
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "five-light-mountain-arrives",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_five_light_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Resources from Hei Fan grotto-heaven are mostly relocated here. The region overflows with life, with musical trees, tea streams, qi death bird groups, more than ten mountains including Five Light Mountain and Immortal Succession Mountain, and a growing regretful spider group as its most important resource. Even so, Mini Southern Border is not filled up.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "overflowing-vitality",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the five mini regions, Mini Southern Border is the richest. It holds Five Light Mountain, Immortal Succession Mountain, Heaven Sealing Mountain and others for more than ten mountains in total, plus a stalactite cave, regretful spiders, a small number of rockmen, a forest of musical trees and tea streams with qi death birds, and Become Dragon Mound.",
      "chapters": [
        1291
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "richest-mini-region",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_heaven_sealing_mountain",
        "loc_become_dragon_mound"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With the frost jades and frost jade essence plundered from Frosty Peak, Fang Yuan could even raise a Mini Frosty Peak inside Mini Southern Border.",
      "chapters": [
        1313
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "frost-jade-prospect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_frosty_peak"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mini Southern Border remains the most developed mini region, with Five Light Mountain, Immortal Succession Mountain, Become Dragon Mound, Heaven Sealing Mountain, a dozen other nameless mountains, coiling thread caves, the stalactite cave, rockmen living in forest and underground, and vegetation such as musical trees, tea streams, and qi death birds.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-mountains",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Fire Bird Mountain, rockman Gu Immortals suppress a near-erupting volcano with an immortal formation after fire path dao marks surge from annexed apertures. They ask Star Collection City to send fire path Gu Immortals to modify the volcano so it can adapt.",
      "chapters": [
        2127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-bird-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_star_collection_city"
      ]
    }
  ],
